    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/886cfe0d95d52ff747dd6a4ccd58928b.avif?t=1755253264\" data-has-big width=800 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swamp Keeper is a Korean-style bow action arena shooter inspired by one-shot, one-kill gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the &quot;Swamp Keeper,&quot; defender of the sacred swamp, armed with only a bow to repel invading enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of archery, defeat waves of foes, and take down their commander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/58052cfb1ad611d7a979684d31320ca0.poster.avif?t=1755253264\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/58052cfb1ad611d7a979684d31320ca0.webm?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/58052cfb1ad611d7a979684d31320ca0.mp4?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ho\u2019s forces have invaded the sacred swamp, targeting its precious resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wielding iron and fire, the enemy has already reached the heart of the swamp shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the sworn guardian of these wetlands, it\u2019s your duty to drive them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/ad99eeee55ce0bd2c32f556535a5cf27.poster.avif?t=1755253264\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/ad99eeee55ce0bd2c32f556535a5cf27.webm?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/ad99eeee55ce0bd2c32f556535a5cf27.mp4?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With support from your allies, traverse the battlefield and restore peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/71813a71c074b361df26976fc95eedd8.poster.avif?t=1755253264\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/71813a71c074b361df26976fc95eedd8.webm?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/71813a71c074b361df26976fc95eedd8.mp4?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull, aim, release \u2014 experience the high-stakes tension of one-shot, one-kill charging bow action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/24ac7e1aab722d83e02591a4e2f99be1.poster.avif?t=1755253264\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/24ac7e1aab722d83e02591a4e2f99be1.webm?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/24ac7e1aab722d83e02591a4e2f99be1.mp4?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft arrows that suit your style, select your skills, and prepare for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/da7c3944a7039bf80844679d7bf2cafb.poster.avif?t=1755253264\" width=756 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/da7c3944a7039bf80844679d7bf2cafb.webm?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/da7c3944a7039bf80844679d7bf2cafb.mp4?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy charming Korean-style anthropomorphic characters and beautifully rendered backgrounds.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/886cfe0d95d52ff747dd6a4ccd58928b.avif?t=1755253264\" data-has-big width=800 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swamp Keeper is a Korean-style bow action arena shooter inspired by one-shot, one-kill gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the &quot;Swamp Keeper,&quot; defender of the sacred swamp, armed with only a bow to repel invading enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of archery, defeat waves of foes, and take down their commander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/58052cfb1ad611d7a979684d31320ca0.poster.avif?t=1755253264\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/58052cfb1ad611d7a979684d31320ca0.webm?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/58052cfb1ad611d7a979684d31320ca0.mp4?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ho\u2019s forces have invaded the sacred swamp, targeting its precious resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wielding iron and fire, the enemy has already reached the heart of the swamp shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the sworn guardian of these wetlands, it\u2019s your duty to drive them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/ad99eeee55ce0bd2c32f556535a5cf27.poster.avif?t=1755253264\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/ad99eeee55ce0bd2c32f556535a5cf27.webm?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/ad99eeee55ce0bd2c32f556535a5cf27.mp4?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With support from your allies, traverse the battlefield and restore peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/71813a71c074b361df26976fc95eedd8.poster.avif?t=1755253264\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/71813a71c074b361df26976fc95eedd8.webm?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/71813a71c074b361df26976fc95eedd8.mp4?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull, aim, release \u2014 experience the high-stakes tension of one-shot, one-kill charging bow action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/24ac7e1aab722d83e02591a4e2f99be1.poster.avif?t=1755253264\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/24ac7e1aab722d83e02591a4e2f99be1.webm?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/24ac7e1aab722d83e02591a4e2f99be1.mp4?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft arrows that suit your style, select your skills, and prepare for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/da7c3944a7039bf80844679d7bf2cafb.poster.avif?t=1755253264\" width=756 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/da7c3944a7039bf80844679d7bf2cafb.webm?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/da7c3944a7039bf80844679d7bf2cafb.mp4?t=1755253264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy charming Korean-style anthropomorphic characters and beautifully rendered backgrounds.</p>",
